  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "**a lot**: in the meanings *very much* and *often*, it usually comes at the end of the clause, after the verb and any object (*I miss you a lot*), although many languages put a similar word before the verb. Before **better** or **more** it comes first: *a lot better*.",
